class:: Vrand
summary:: Prand over visual events
categories:: Libraries>VisualServer
related:: Classes/Prand, Classes/Vseq, Classes/Vwrand, Classes/Vbind, Guides/VisualServer

description::

Returns a link::Classes/Prand:: that randomly picks visual events from a list (same item normalisation as link::Classes/Vseq::).

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
argument:: list
Events or instrument symbols.
argument:: repeats
Default code::inf::.
argument:: view
Default code::\default::.
returns:: a link::Classes/Prand::.

EXAMPLES::

code::
Vrand([\circle, \square,
    (instrument: \pulse, endSize: 200)], inf, \demo).vplay;
::
